      <section id="sec-12" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">12</span> Merchant Use of Shopper Images</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">Merchants may not use identifiable Shopper User Images or Result Images for advertising, marketing, social-media promotion, product campaigns, model imagery, or other independent commercial purposes, unless the Shopper has separately provided appropriate permission for that specific use.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-13" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">13</span> Data Security</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">We implement reasonable technical and organizational safeguards including encryption in transit, encryption at rest, secure API tokens, access controls, multi-factor authentication, and security monitoring.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-14" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">14</span> Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">Subject to applicable law, you have the right to request access, correction, consent withdrawal, deletion, restriction, and data portability. To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:app@lookify.in" style="color:#C5613F;font-weight:700">app@lookify.in</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-15" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">15</span> Cookies, Analytics and Tracking</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">Our components may use essential cookies and session technologies for core functionality and session security. Optional tracking is subject to user consent choices where required by law.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-16" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">16</span> Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">The App is not directed to individuals under 18 years of age without parental/guardian consent. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-17" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">17</span> International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">Your information may be processed on servers located outside your country of residence, including in India and other provider regions, subject to appropriate contractual and legal safeguards.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-18" class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-section-title"><span class="legal-section-num">18</span> Merchant Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="legal-text">Merchants using Lookify must disclose App usage in their privacy notices, obtain required shopper consents, honor privacy choices, and use shopper data solely for lawful purposes.</p>
      </section>

